@startuml
!include ../../../_common/style.puml

title Consume L2 - ConsumeDecision Provider Ack Mapping

box "Core Consume" #FFF3E0
participant MessageConsumeDispatcher
end box
box "Provider" #FFEBEE
participant KafkaConsumeDecisionMapper
participant PulsarConsumeDecisionMapper
participant RocketMqConsumeDecisionMapper
end box

MessageConsumeDispatcher -> KafkaConsumeDecisionMapper: map(ACK)
KafkaConsumeDecisionMapper --> MessageConsumeDispatcher: commit offset + 1
MessageConsumeDispatcher -> KafkaConsumeDecisionMapper: map(RETRY)
KafkaConsumeDecisionMapper --> MessageConsumeDispatcher: no commit / seek current
MessageConsumeDispatcher -> KafkaConsumeDecisionMapper: map(DISCARD)
KafkaConsumeDecisionMapper --> MessageConsumeDispatcher: commit offset + 1

MessageConsumeDispatcher -> PulsarConsumeDecisionMapper: map(ACK / DISCARD)
PulsarConsumeDecisionMapper --> MessageConsumeDispatcher: acknowledge
MessageConsumeDispatcher -> PulsarConsumeDecisionMapper: map(RETRY)
PulsarConsumeDecisionMapper --> MessageConsumeDispatcher: negativeAcknowledge

MessageConsumeDispatcher -> RocketMqConsumeDecisionMapper: map(ACK / DISCARD)
RocketMqConsumeDecisionMapper --> MessageConsumeDispatcher: CONSUME_SUCCESS
MessageConsumeDispatcher -> RocketMqConsumeDecisionMapper: map(RETRY)
RocketMqConsumeDecisionMapper --> MessageConsumeDispatcher: RECONSUME_LATER
@enduml
